  "limitations": [
    "The threaded candidate contains several accumulated runtime changes; this is not an isolated test of threading or of the removed state-table check.",
    "The comparison does not isolate address-space-switch costs or prove a unique cause for the throughput difference.",
    "Prepared point queries were slower with one and four sessions; 16-session range aggregation was also slower.",
    "Short rounds on a shared VM do not establish statistical equivalence or a universal speedup.",
    "Persistent-session results do not measure connection churn or embedded worker-pool scheduling.",
    "This is not a current release, C/Python package, or Wasm benchmark."
  ],
